175
00:13:53,505 --> 00:13:56,025
We like dragons. We deify dragons.

176
00:13:56,105 --> 00:13:58,065
Dragons are like our ideals.

177
00:13:58,145 --> 00:14:00,585
Our idea should incorporate
this kind of ideal.

178
00:14:00,665 --> 00:14:03,545
Instead of focusing on the landscape,

179
00:14:03,625 --> 00:14:07,665
